      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name} The translation is the same even if the location is different. However, the text displayed in the action menu is broken in inappropriate places. (It should be \"Quick {ln} Action\".) Therefore, if this string is separated for the Quick Menu and for the Action Menu, the problem of improper line breaks can be solved.\n\nHowever, this problem of improper line breaks is not limited to \"Quick Actions\". Personally, I think that the string used in the action menu should be added as a new string",
